    "sections": {
        "description": "Patterns Store Front is a modern, block-based WordPress theme that seamlessly integrates with the Patterns Store plugin, developed by the core team at PatternsWP.com. Designed for designers and developers, it provides an elegant way to showcase pattern kits and individual patterns. With Full Site Editing (FSE) support, users can easily customize headers, footers, and layouts via the WordPress block editor. The theme includes responsive, pre-designed templates that beautifully display pattern collections, offering a visually engaging experience across devices, and making it perfect for organizing and presenting pattern design assets professionally."
    },
